  "research_status": "COMPLETE — all 170 episodes of Black Clover classified canon/filler/mixed. The 17-episode pure-filler core (29, 66, 68, 82, 123-125, 131, 134-135, 142-148) is corroborated by two independently-fetched sources (QuoteTheAnime, CBR) agreeing exactly. Corrected 2026-08-25: this file originally recorded only episode 102 as mixed, with a disclosed low-confidence gap around several other candidate mixed episodes that different sources couldn't agree on, and recorded episode 149 as canon after resolving a QuoteTheAnime/CBR vs. ScreenRant/joinkaminari disagreement in favor of the first pair. Andreas independently found and confirmed a fuller, internally-consistent reading of QuoteTheAnime's own page (a complete, gap-free partition of all 170 episodes) that resolves both gaps: episodes 2, 8, 9, 12, 30, 69, and 102 are mixed, and the filler run extends through episode 149 (18 filler episodes total, not 17) — applied as corrections to the affected episodes' own status_notes rather than a rewrite of this whole file, since the underlying source (QuoteTheAnime) was already cited here, just not read completely the first time. CBR's own arc-level count (17, ending at 148) still disagrees with episode 149 specifically — noted on that episode rather than silently dropped. No episode titles included — left for the existing backfill_episode_titles_from_anilist.py (#73) pass, same as Dragon Ball Z/Super. Complete, gap-free, non-overlapping coverage of 1-170 confirmed before writing this file.",
